          "title": "You'll want to know: પોસાવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પોસાવું — posāvũ — \"to be within one's means\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો અમને નવી ગાડી પોસાશે તો અમે તે ખરીદીશું. jo amne navī gāḍī posāśe to ame te kharīdīśũ. If we can afford a new car, we will buy it."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): તે ભાડું તેને પોસાયું, te bhāḍũ tene posāyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પોસાવું (posāvũ) is filed by CDIAL under Sanskrit pōṣáyati, \"nourishes\", beside a Gujarati posvũ, \"to nourish\" (CDIAL 8410); what one can keep up and pay for is affordable. The person takes ને: મને પોસાય છે."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
