          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "રાજીનામું (rājīnāmũ) is usually traced to Persian rāzīnāma, \"a letter of consent\"; in Gujarati it is the letter that gives up a post, and one gives it: રાજીનામું આપવું."
